<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised</p>
<p>interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and</p>
<p>brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six</p>
<p>months.</p>
<p>	    O/N =  1.71% (Discount)	  O/N = 2.56% (Discount)</p>
<p>	    T/N =  2.56% (Discount)	  T/N = 2.56% (Discount)</p>
<p>		   Oct 31, 1996			Oct 30, 1996</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  1.36%	1 month forward =  1.70%</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  3.07%	2 month forward =  3.07%</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  4.66%	3 month forward =  4.89%</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  5.46%	4 month forward =  5.54%</p>
<p>	  5 month forward =  6.14%	5 month forward =  6.34%</p>
<p>	  6 month forward =  6.23%	6 month forward =  6.44%</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
